        "conclusion": "The patient presents with a complex phenotype including tingling, a tumor, racing heart, fainting, high TSH, polydipsia, and weight loss. Despite these symptoms, the analysis did not identify any specific candidate genes strongly associated with this combination of findings. Further investigation is needed to clarify the underlying cause.",
        "conclusionCode": [
          {
            "coding": [
              {
                "display": "Sporadic pheochromocytoma/secreting paraganglioma"
              }
            ],
            "text": "Sporadic pheochromocytoma/secreting paraganglioma"
          },
